    <briefdescription>
<para>Functions in this group model <ref refid="group___l_l_v_m_c_support_types_1ga113ce952344691b8304a43a314f8be17" kindref="member">LLVMValueRef</ref> instances that correspond to constants referring to scalar types. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>For integer types, the <ref refid="group___l_l_v_m_c_support_types_1gab81b4df33167d47174f9b86a75e3be88" kindref="member">LLVMTypeRef</ref> parameter should correspond to a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_integer_type" kindref="compound">llvm::IntegerType</ref> instance and the returned <ref refid="group___l_l_v_m_c_support_types_1ga113ce952344691b8304a43a314f8be17" kindref="member">LLVMValueRef</ref> will correspond to a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_constant_int" kindref="compound">llvm::ConstantInt</ref>.</para>
<para>For floating point types, the <ref refid="group___l_l_v_m_c_support_types_1gab81b4df33167d47174f9b86a75e3be88" kindref="member">LLVMTypeRef</ref> returned corresponds to a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_constant_f_p" kindref="compound">llvm::ConstantFP</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
  </compounddef>
